31,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I have information. Mizuki is the Werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"That was fast. @Toshio, are you the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,What? That's a blatant lie. I am a Villager. Toshio is trying to frame me.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Oh no, this is already scary. Is it really true?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,A bold claim so early. I wonder if it's a gamble.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I am the Seer. I divined Mizuki last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Toshio is lying, he's risking a lot. But if Mizuki is the wolf, we should act.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,@Toshio is likely the Werewolf or Possessed trying to eliminate me quickly to gain trust.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
