40,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, your reaction is quite strong.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I have no reason to lie. The village wins if we execute her now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm inclined to believe the Seer.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Don't be fooled by his ""reliable"" persona. He's manipulating you.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minato,,I... I think I believe Toshio-san.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,The logic of a Seer revealing the wolf immediately is a common strategy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's vote.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
